<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally weak on moderate demand and moderate to heavy offerings.  Select chuck, round and  loin cuts steady to weak, while rib cuts lower. Choice chuck, rib and loin cuts steady to weak, while round cuts firm. Beef trimmings steady to weak on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>331 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 31 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>25 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =	96.23	 95.44	 92.78	 91.86</p>
<p>Change	   -0.46	 -0.06	 -0.27	 -0.45</p>
<p>Rib	  149.91	147.65	138.33	138.62</p>
<p>Chuck	 69.17	 67.70	 70.27	 67.51</p>
<p>Round	 87.49	 87.49	 87.07	 87.07</p>
<p>Loin	 141.71	141.23	130.76	130.13</p>
<p>Brisket     62.90	 62.90	 61.78	 61.78</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  62.14	 62.08	 62.33	 62.19</p>
<p>Flank	 56.05	 56.05	 55.33	 55.33</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
